+They select cumulant rates of the signed displacement record
+
+    Y(t)=integral_0^t a(x(s))*v_y(s) ds,
+    a(x)=cos(density_harmonic*x) for quadrature="cos",
+    a(x)=sin(density_harmonic*x) for quadrature="sin".
+
+Use the actual continuous finite-mass trajectory and the unwrapped transverse
+coordinate y; there is no jump or reset of this record at a spatial period or
+valve switch. The detector applies no force and does not alter any contact or
+potential. It counts signed transverse displacement with the stated spatial
+weight, with no additional noise, time filtering or background subtraction.
+The process starts in the stationary joint distribution of x modulo 2*pi,
+velocity, retained contact force and valve. Translation invariance makes the
+choice of initial y immaterial.
